    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1191-a1">

                <pb facs="1022" n="918" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg918"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure—Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">U. S. S. Pittsburg</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Guaymas, Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-07-09">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 9, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Defense Guaymas continues to be strengthened. Americans still on <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Glacier</hi>. Six hundred Chinese under protection <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Pittsburg</hi> in camp on small island in outer
                    harbor.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cowles</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
